    "Input: x = [-2.0, 0.0, 2.0]\n\nOutput: {\"sigmoid_derivative\": [0.104994, 0.25, 0.104994], \"tanh_derivative\": [0.070651, 1.0, 0.070651], \"relu_derivative\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], \"swish_derivative\": [-0.090784, 0.5, 1.090784]}\n\nExplanation: Evaluated calculus_activation_derivatives under standard test conditions."
